{"logId": "1a1c3b5d-2c83-4b3c-af0a-5d575d6de61d", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1190, "height": 1684, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "DL", "block_bbox": [121, 93, 193, 128], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[121.0, 93.0], [193.0, 93.0], [193.0, 128.0], [121.0, 128.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "被盗时应及时挂失。", "block_bbox": [95, 170, 269, 195], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[95.0, 170.0], [269.0, 170.0], [269.0, 195.0], [95.0, 195.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "6、防止各类闲杂人员骗门入室，窥探虚实，伺机作案；对回收废旧之人，应离家门较远的地方买卖；如遇收费、检修、查表、查线、安装、快递等人员，检查其证件，并与对方单位联系求证。", "block_bbox": [94, 205, 873, 302], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[94.0, 205.0], [873.0, 205.0], [873.0, 302.0], [94.0, 302.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "7、夜晚睡觉时，不要将包、现金、手机等贵重物品放在客厅，应随身带入卧室并将卧室门反锁。", "block_bbox": [94, 312, 867, 373], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[94.0, 312.0], [867.0, 312.0], [867.0, 373.0], [94.0, 373.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "8、不要在家门口你认为“隐蔽”的地方放备用钥匙。", "block_bbox": [95, 383, 558, 409], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[95.0, 383.0], [558.0, 383.0], [558.0, 409.0], [95.0, 409.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "9、与人合租房屋时，特别要加强防盗意识，人员较多且进出复杂，一定要将贵重物品随身携带。", "block_bbox": [94, 419, 867, 479], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[94.0, 419.0], [867.0, 419.0], [867.0, 479.0], [94.0, 479.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "10、家里放置少量的现金，以免歹徒没有盗窃到财物后对人发生人身伤害。", "block_bbox": [95, 490, 748, 516], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[95.0, 490.0], [748.0, 490.0], [748.0, 516.0], [95.0, 516.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "11、白天发生入室盗窃后，不要移动现场，及时报警。", "block_bbox": [95, 526, 570, 551], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[95.0, 526.0], [570.0, 526.0], [570.0, 551.0], [95.0, 551.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "12、晚上发生入室盗窃，不要惊动歹徒，不要打开电源，要想法保护好自身安全，待歹徒离开后及时报警。", "block_bbox": [94, 561, 878, 622], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[94.0, 561.0], [878.0, 561.0], [878.0, 622.0], [94.0, 622.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [898, 265, 1130, 462], "block_id": 9, "block_order": null, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[898.0, 265.0], [1130.0, 265.0], [1130.0, 462.0], [898.0, 462.0]]}, {"block_label": "footer", "block_content": "生活篇--网络诈骗", "block_bbox": [94, 1048, 309, 1080], "block_id": 10, "block_order": null, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[94.0, 1048.0], [309.0, 1048.0], [309.0, 1080.0], [94.0, 1080.0]]}, {"block_label": "footer_image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [1000, 603, 1121, 634], "block_id": 11, "block_order": null, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[1000.0, 603.0], [1121.0, 603.0], [1121.0, 634.0], [1000.0, 634.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.3082098066806793, "coordinate": [121, 93, 193, 128], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[121.0, 93.0], [193.0, 93.0], [193.0, 128.0], [121.0, 128.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7738536596298218, "coordinate": [95, 170, 269, 195], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[95.0, 170.0], [269.0, 170.0], [269.0, 195.0], [95.0, 195.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9318630695343018, "coordinate": [94, 205, 873, 302], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[94.0, 205.0], [873.0, 205.0], [873.0, 302.0], [94.0, 302.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9067279100418091, "coordinate": [94, 312, 867, 373], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[94.0, 312.0], [867.0, 312.0], [867.0, 373.0], [94.0, 373.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8257948160171509, "coordinate": [95, 383, 558, 409], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[95.0, 383.0], [558.0, 383.0], [558.0, 409.0], [95.0, 409.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9140040874481201, "coordinate": [94, 419, 867, 479], "order": 6, "polygon_points": [[94.0, 419.0], [867.0, 419.0], [867.0, 479.0], [94.0, 479.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8380334973335266, "coordinate": [95, 490, 748, 516], "order": 7, "polygon_points": [[95.0, 490.0], [748.0, 490.0], [748.0, 516.0], [95.0, 516.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8286380767822266, "coordinate": [95, 526, 570, 551], "order": 8, "polygon_points": [[95.0, 526.0], [570.0, 526.0], [570.0, 551.0], [95.0, 551.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9084122776985168, "coordinate": [94, 561, 878, 622], "order": 9, "polygon_points": [[94.0, 561.0], [878.0, 561.0], [878.0, 622.0], [94.0, 622.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.8906034231185913, "coordinate": [898, 265, 1130, 462], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[898.0, 265.0], [1130.0, 265.0], [1130.0, 462.0], [898.0, 462.0]]}, {"cls_id": 8, "label": "footer", "score": 0.4676187038421631, "coordinate": [94, 1048, 309, 1080], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[94.0, 1048.0], [309.0, 1048.0], [309.0, 1080.0], [94.0, 1080.0]]}, {"cls_id": 9, "label": "footer_image", "score": 0.39306819438934326, "coordinate": [1000, 603, 1121, 634], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[1000.0, 603.0], [1121.0, 603.0], [1121.0, 634.0], [1000.0, 634.0]]}]}}, "markdown": {"text": "## DL\n\n被盗时应及时挂失。\n\n6、防止各类闲杂人员骗门入室，窥探虚实，伺机作案；对回收废旧之人，应离家门较远的地方买卖；如遇收费、检修、查表、查线、安装、快递等人员，检查其证件，并与对方单位联系求证。\n\n7、夜晚睡觉时，不要将包、现金、手机等贵重物品放在客厅，应随身带入卧室并将卧室门反锁。\n\n8、不要在家门口你认为“隐蔽”的地方放备用钥匙。\n\n9、与人合租房屋时，特别要加强防盗意识，人员较多且进出复杂，一定要将贵重物品随身携带。\n\n10、家里放置少量的现金，以免歹徒没有盗窃到财物后对人发生人身伤害。\n\n11、白天发生入室盗窃后，不要移动现场，及时报警。\n\n12、晚上发生入室盗窃，不要惊动歹徒，不要打开电源，要想法保护好自身安全，待歹徒离开后及时报警。\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_898_265_1130_462.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"19%\" /></div>\n", "images": {"imgs/img_in_image_box_898_265_1130_462.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//1a1c3b5d-2c83-4b3c-af0a-5d575d6de61d/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_898_265_1130_462.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T10%3A51%3A59Z%2F-1%2F%2F4a49deafdaf770109b071a26004c570b88a7eead1269d6076b0792e0208d04fe", "imgs/img_in_footer_image_box_1000_603_1121_634.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//1a1c3b5d-2c83-4b3c-af0a-5d575d6de61d/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_footer_image_box_1000_603_1121_634.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T10%3A51%3A59Z%2F-1%2F%2F94c7cb9892f33fabd54590b09a25dd0b9b07cc0362b37bcff271b46265e9eb3d"}}, "outputImages": {"layout_det_res": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//1a1c3b5d-2c83-4b3c-af0a-5d575d6de61d/layout_det_res_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T10%3A52%3A00Z%2F-1%2F%2F614d22ed0eec26b259511a972eddd3ef92e6f05774236cd211155db82d9b1157"}, "inputImage": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//1a1c3b5d-2c83-4b3c-af0a-5d575d6de61d/input_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T10%3A52%3A00Z%2F-1%2F%2F3c1ecc0c3ba853c9775e9f5701ba2c6e2dee57eadf2a954e0aa4fc6789c5ac10"}], "dataInfo": {"numPages": 1, "pages": [{"width": 1190, "height": 1684}], "type": "pdf"}, "preprocessedImages": ["https://ppline